  + [next_possible_supersession_slice] is P2-S02 for common envelope, authority vocabulary, and freshness refresh
  + [next_possible_supersession_slice] is P2-S03 for record-specific schema and natural-key matrix refresh
  + [storage_supersession_authorized] is false
  + [implementation_supersession_authorized] is false

  = must: preserve current schema authority for existing implemented proof packs until refreshed and accepted
  = must: mark downstream consumers stale if a later P2 slice supersedes a schema input

